        "position": 6,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<ul><li>AP&nbsp;Math:&nbsp;Calculus&nbsp;AB&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;score&nbsp;of&nbsp;3&nbsp;or&nbsp;higher&nbsp;(or&nbsp;AP&nbsp;Math:&nbsp;Calculus&nbsp;BC&nbsp;score&nbsp;of&nbsp;3)&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;department&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;Math&nbsp;51&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;at&nbsp;Berkeley.&nbsp;</li><li>AP&nbsp;Math:&nbsp;Calculus&nbsp;BC&nbsp;score&nbsp;of&nbsp;4&nbsp;or&nbsp;5&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;Math&nbsp;52&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;at&nbsp;Berkeley.</li><li>AP&nbsp;Micro/Macroeconomics:&nbsp;AP&nbsp;scores&nbsp;of&nbsp;4&nbsp;or&nbsp;5&nbsp;in&nbsp;BOTH&nbsp;exams&nbsp;is&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;Economics&nbsp;requirement.</li></ul>",
